Subject: [PATCH] feat(learn): candy-map learning path (winding candy road,
 glossy lesson sweets, three unit worlds)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Road through all lessons, striped where already learned; lessons as round candies
  (number, gold + star when done, lock when closed), "Học tiếp!" bubble on the next one
- Unit worlds (strawberry, mint, grape) with ribbon banner, progress counter, finish trophy
  and side decorations from a fixed seed (candyLayout.ts, pure + tested)
- Goal, sync and legend as candy cards above the map
- Same behaviour: statuses from lessonStatus, details card (role=group, Esc closes,
  Bắt đầu / Học lại link, locked hint), daily goal progressbar
- Colours only in tokens.css; texts in i18n/vi.ts

Not yet run here: pnpm lint / test / typecheck and E2E (no npm access on the agent machine).

